22. DATA MINIMIZATION

There is no reason to publish the entire world on a blockchain.

The architecture can keep:

- formulas;
- designs;
- quantities;
- suppliers;
- costs;
- proprietary processes;
- commercial information;

off-chain.

What is necessary to demonstrate integrity and state can be represented through commitments.

Thus:

Store the proof, not necessarily the whole world.

