Payment 3 → 18 sats
Payment 4 → 7 sats
...

The records can accumulate during the Epoch.

At the end:

TOTAL REWARD
↓
CONTRIBUTION ACCOUNTING
↓
PAYOUT

This separates:

payment frequency

from

settlement frequency.

